     null,
     null,
     {
      "person": {
       "person": "main.lea",
       "expression": "NERVOUS"
      }
     },
     {
      "person": {
       "person": "bergen.male-goatman-white",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "This stellar specimen you see here is my greatest creation.",
       "transl": "Dieses herausragende Exemplar hier ist meine wahrlich größte Schöpfung."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "bergen.male-goatman-white",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "He has developed great intelligence and holds power over all the lesser goats that you fought.",
       "transl": "Er hat eine wahnsinnige Intelligenz entwickelt und kontrolliert all die niederen Ziegen, die du bisher bekämpft hast."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "bergen.male-goatman-white",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "In fact, all of them are genetically based off of him.\\. So you could call him the father of goats.",
       "transl": "Genau genommen stammen alle anderen Ziegen genetisch von ihm ab.\\. Du könntest ihn also auch den Vater der Ziegen nennen."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "bergen.male-goatman-white",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "He is indeed the pinnacle of all that is goat.\\.\\. And I am his master!",
       "transl": "Er ist somit der Gipfel von allem, was eine Ziege ausmacht.\\.\\. Und ich bin sein Meister!"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "bergen.male-goatman-white",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "...!",
       "transl": "...!"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.lea",
       "expression": "SURPRISED"
      }
