     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "\\v[lore.title.seeker], come in.\\. Bergen Guard speaking, can you hear us?",
       "transl": "Seeker!\\. Hier spricht die Bergen-Wache, kannst du uns hören?"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "guards.captain-female-hairbun",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Hi!",
       "transl": "Привіт!"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.lea",
       "expression": "SURPRISED"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "...",
       "transl": "..."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.lea",
       "expression": "SURPRISED_TOWARD"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "[nods]",
       "transl": "[киває]"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.lea",
       "expression": "NOD"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Good!\\. Our guards have observed movement coming from the Horncave.\\. Did you find anything?",
       "transl": "Gut!\\. Unsere Wachen haben Bewegungen aus der Hornhöhle beobachtet.\\. Hast du etwas gefunden?"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "guards.captain-female-hairbun",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "[nods]",
       "transl": "[киває]"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.lea",
       "expression": "NOD"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "...",
       "transl": "..."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.lea",
       "expression": "THINKING"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Lea. Meet. Lea! How?",
       "transl": "Lea. Treffen. Lea! Wie?"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.lea",
       "expression": "SURPRISED"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Goats AND Papaguns?\\. Working together in our cold mountains?\\. What is this madness?",
       "transl": "Ziegen UND Papaguns?\\. Arbeiten in unseren kalten Bergen zusammen?\\. Was ist das für ein Wahnsinn?"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "guards.captain-female-hairbun",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "There must be something bigger behind this.\\. We will need to start more investiga\\..\\..\\..\\. wait!",
       "transl": "Da steckt vermutlich mehr dahinter.\\. Wir müssen der Sache auf den Grund geh-\\..\\..\\..\\. Warte!"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "guards.captain-female-hairbun",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "...!?",
       "transl": "...!?"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.lea",
       "expression": "SURPRISED"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "\\v[lore.title.seeker], one of our Guards urgently needs reinforcements on the \\c[3]Windy Climb\\c[0]!",
       "transl": "Seeker, eine unserer Wachen benötigt dringend Verstärkung am \\c[3]Windigen Aufstieg\\c[0]!"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "guards.captain-female-hairbun",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "It seems like he ran into a group that tried to smuggle out a huge crate.\\. Please get there quickly!",
       "transl": "Er hat wohl eine Gruppe erwischt, die versucht hat, eine riesige Kiste herauszuschmuggeln.\\. Du musst sofort hin!<<A<<[CHANGED 2021/05/22]"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "guards.captain-female-hairbun",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
